[00:01.931]If I could write you a song and make you fall in love
{"若我能为你写首歌 让你坠入爱河"}
[00:06.113]I would already have you up under my arm
{"此刻你早该依偎在我臂弯"}
[00:09.602]I used up all of my tricks, I hope that you like this
{"我已用尽所有招数 但愿你能喜欢"}
[00:13.542]But, you probably won't, you think you're cooler than me
{"但你大概不会 自以为比我酷"}
[00:17.161]You got designer shades just to hide your face
{"戴着名牌墨镜只为遮住脸庞"}
[00:20.948]And you wear 'em around like you're cooler than me
{"招摇过市仿佛比我更嚣张"}
[00:24.600]And you never say "hey" or remember my name
{"从不说声「嗨」 也记不住我名字"}
[00:28.402]And it's probably 'cause you think you're cooler than me…
